{
  "slug": "13-spatial-db",
  "model": "fish-speech-1.5",
  "generatedAt": "2026-11-05T03:57:36.893Z",
  "segmentCount": 80,
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "白话版（先看这个）",
      "hash": "6977374ca2a45355",
      "audio": "seg00.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946084118_13-spatial-db-seg00.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "老司机 3 分钟经验之谈。看懂这块，本章就懂了 80%；下面是可以慢慢查的完整版。",
      "hash": "48e4106b6c21b470",
      "audio": "seg01.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946094038_13-spatial-db-seg01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "这章解决什么问题 ：空间分析在代码和数据库里怎么落地：前端用 Turf.js，后端用 PostGIS。空间运算本身不难，难的是 单位、SRID、索引 三件事，搞错任何一件，结果都静默地错。",
      "hash": "64c09fef91dee718",
      "audio": "seg02.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946092298_13-spatial-db-seg02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "我的经验一句话 ：把空间函数当普通 API 用，但 永远先问单位 。两个最出名的坑我都见过：",
      "hash": "e7ede2cee9ee2a47",
      "audio": "seg03.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946089914_13-spatial-db-seg03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "turf.buffer(point, 1000) 想画 1000 米的服务圈，结果 Turf 默认单位是 公里 ，画了个 1000 公里的巨无霸，覆盖了半个中国。",
      "hash": "aa20ec7e44bed103",
      "audio": "seg04.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946091705_13-spatial-db-seg04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "PostGIS 里 geometry 类型在 4326 下 STDistance 返回的是「度」——不是米，没有业务意义。要米，用 geography 类型或先转投影。",
      "hash": "c43689626d91e45b",
      "audio": "seg05.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946088149_13-spatial-db-seg05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "我见过的坑（你大概率也会踩） ：",
      "hash": "a9ac3abff6d2267a",
      "audio": "seg06.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946094872_13-spatial-db-seg06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "忘了建空间索引 ：百万条数据的相交查询跑几分钟；建个 GiST 索引（ CREATE INDEX ... USING GIST(geom) ）变毫秒。",
      "hash": "66ee8cafcef668f1",
      "audio": "seg07.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946094467_13-spatial-db-seg07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "SRID 不一致直接 join ：两张表一个 4326 一个 3857，查询结果全错还不报错。先 STTransform 统一。",
      "hash": "8b115300adaa1ec0",
      "audio": "seg08.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946097968_13-spatial-db-seg08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "前端扛大数据 ：十万条要素全推给浏览器直接卡死。重计算下沉到 PostGIS，前端只拿结果。",
      "hash": "4ebeb8ef1c43c59a",
      "audio": "seg09.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946097164_13-spatial-db-seg09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "必记 3 条 ：",
      "hash": "4e91eabe2887e921",
      "audio": "seg10.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946097954_13-spatial-db-seg10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Turf 默认单位是公里，不是米",
      "hash": "51b358590f44c58f",
      "audio": "seg11.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946100826_13-spatial-db-seg11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "PostGIS 里 geography 按米算球面距离，geometry 看 SRID 单位",
      "hash": "ba419e88e92aabcc",
      "audio": "seg12.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946099128_13-spatial-db-seg12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "空间表必须建 GiST 索引；SRID 不一致先转换",
      "hash": "989c5672387a76e7",
      "audio": "seg13.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946096758_13-spatial-db-seg13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "一句话",
      "hash": "a25aca1814333b3a",
      "audio": "seg14.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946099622_13-spatial-db-seg14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "空间运算本身不难，难的是「单位、SRID、索引」三件事；搞错任何一件，结果就会静默地出错。",
      "hash": "e4d96758ee0b7a51",
      "audio": "seg15.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946103586_13-spatial-db-seg15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "1. 前端：Turf.js",
      "hash": "c9f309010159fd75",
      "audio": "seg16.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946130816_13-spatial-db-seg16.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "turf.distance(a, b) 默认单位 kilometers 。",
      "hash": "167e26d1fb14ee91",
      "audio": "seg17.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946136775_13-spatial-db-seg17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "turf.area(polygon) 返回 平方米 （球面计算）。",
      "hash": "248f2cb94ff8c203",
      "audio": "seg18.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946139316_13-spatial-db-seg18.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "turf.buffer 的半径单位由 options.units 指定， 默认 kilometers 。",
      "hash": "be41436377b360b6",
      "audio": "seg19.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946134806_13-spatial-db-seg19.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Turf（「特尔夫」）在经纬度上做球面近似，适合交互与轻量分析；大数据、精确椭球计算交给后端。",
      "hash": "636b37e52dda863a",
      "audio": "seg20.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946142182_13-spatial-db-seg20.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "turf.distance 默认单位是 公里 ，不是米",
      "hash": "801456e78c7c6056",
      "audio": "seg21.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946142096_13-spatial-db-seg21.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "turf.area 返回 平方米 （球面近似）",
      "hash": "edd8c589f6794e22",
      "audio": "seg22.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946145343_13-spatial-db-seg22.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "turf.buffer 半径单位由 options.units 决定， 默认公里",
      "hash": "851c4c72dd267920",
      "audio": "seg23.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946145448_13-spatial-db-seg23.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Turf 是球面近似，适合交互；精确椭球计算交给后端",
      "hash": "619c3461c2fc88c4",
      "audio": "seg24.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946143152_13-spatial-db-seg24.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "想给一个门店画 1 公里的服务范围：",
      "hash": "eeb665496fdb016f",
      "audio": "seg25.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946151694_13-spatial-db-seg25.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "漏掉 units 时半径默认按 公里 算，写 1000 想表达「1000 米」，实际画出一个 1000 公里的巨型缓冲区。地图上放大看局部根本察觉不到，等业务方发现就晚了。",
      "hash": "68443fcee5bcf772",
      "audio": "seg26.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946148273_13-spatial-db-seg26.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "2. 后端：PostGIS 的两种几何",
      "hash": "e6c9d523bb51222b",
      "audio": "seg27.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946150163_13-spatial-db-seg27.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "（本节含表格，建议查看原文）",
      "hash": "c6f7ee60d35a4684",
      "audio": "seg28.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946155257_13-spatial-db-seg28.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "北京 (116.4, 39.9) 与上海 (121.5, 31.2) 之间量距离：",
      "hash": "5342a56255532c63",
      "audio": "seg29.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946155981_13-spatial-db-seg29.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "geometry（SRID 4326） ：把经纬度当平面坐标算直线距离： sqrt((121.5-116.4)² + (31.2-39.9)²) = sqrt(5.1² + 8.7²) 约等于 10.1 返回 10.1 ，单位是「度」，既不是公里也不是米，没有业务意义。",
      "hash": "45afbe31d09300f5",
      "audio": "seg30.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946156048_13-spatial-db-seg30.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "geography ：沿椭球面量测，返回约 1068000 ，单位是 米 ，约 1068 公里，和地图软件量的基本一致。",
      "hash": "f098d72f3f0a6294",
      "audio": "seg31.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946155309_13-spatial-db-seg31.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "同一个函数 STDistance ，类型不同，答案差 10 万倍，而且 不报任何错 。",
      "hash": "a546ec3cd41b3e0a",
      "audio": "seg32.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946153647_13-spatial-db-seg32.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "3. 必记函数",
      "hash": "7734fa2969cca54b",
      "audio": "seg33.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946153115_13-spatial-db-seg33.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "STTransform 会 换算坐标 ； STSetSRID 只 贴标签不换算 ，不改变任何坐标值",
      "hash": "46c33ead63ead13f",
      "audio": "seg34.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946160410_13-spatial-db-seg34.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "STContains(a, b) 是「a 包含 b」， STWithin(a, b) 是「a 在 b 内」， 方向相反 ，参数别写反",
      "hash": "963f07339a28fdfc",
      "audio": "seg35.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946159381_13-spatial-db-seg35.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "判断「距离不超过 r」用 STDWithin(a, b, r) ，不要用 STDistance 再比较，前者能用索引",
      "hash": "574c4c8461b3641d",
      "audio": "seg36.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946167085_13-spatial-db-seg36.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "STBuffer / STArea / STLength 的单位 = 当前 CRS的单位 ，4326 上就是「度」",
      "hash": "0605149d02eb8d75",
      "audio": "seg37.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946160345_13-spatial-db-seg37.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "4. 叠加函数族：合并、求交、求差",
      "hash": "785d1a52367e337d",
      "audio": "seg38.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946160179_13-spatial-db-seg38.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "第 10 章讲叠置分析的「语义」（交/并/差解决什么问题），这里补上 PostGIS的「语法」：",
      "hash": "818c6e242a9f52c5",
      "audio": "seg39.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946160274_13-spatial-db-seg39.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "空间连接（把位置当外键）的完整 SQL 长这样：",
      "hash": "2c9742d44ebdab86",
      "audio": "seg40.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946168412_13-spatial-db-seg40.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "大几何与大表 ：一个几万个顶点的行政边界，每次相交判断都很贵。 STSubdivide(geom) 把大几何切成小碎块，配合 GiST（「吉斯特」）的 && 粗筛，能让大表叠加快一个数量级：",
      "hash": "06f3d2d34e516488",
      "audio": "seg41.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946161597_13-spatial-db-seg41.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "有效性检查 （第 05 章的概念，这里是工程落地）：",
      "hash": "f0e54dd383c9fd4a",
      "audio": "seg42.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946166515_13-spatial-db-seg42.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "STUnion 真合并（融边界、去重叠）； STCollect 只打包（快，边界还在）。聚合统计用 Union，简单分组用 Collect",
      "hash": "aeceeffc7e407b27",
      "audio": "seg43.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946166937_13-spatial-db-seg43.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "STIntersection 求交、 STDifference 求差，选址 = 交，剔除 = 差",
      "hash": "0a38ce6bb6d6b181",
      "audio": "seg44.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946163150_13-spatial-db-seg44.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "大表叠加前先 STSubdivide 切碎大几何，配合索引快一个数量级",
      "hash": "b6421fec715dadb2",
      "audio": "seg45.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946168664_13-spatial-db-seg45.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "入库先跑 STIsValid ，脏数据用 STMakeValid 修复",
      "hash": "27eb7e72f2f303ce",
      "audio": "seg46.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946171763_13-spatial-db-seg46.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "表： poi(id, geom) （点）、 districts(id, name, geom) （面），都是 EPSG:4326。 写 SQL：给每个 POI挂上所在区的 name ；没有落在任何区里的 POI 也要保留（提示：LEFT JOIN）。",
      "hash": "5ab981ba85810ccd",
      "audio": "seg47.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946170225_13-spatial-db-seg47.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "需求：找「地铁站 500 m 服务范围 ∩ 商业用地」的候选地块（米制 CRS 32650）。",
      "hash": "b1ffa55e7f107342",
      "audio": "seg48.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946171533_13-spatial-db-seg48.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "5. 索引：让查询真的快",
      "hash": "6e75812097d6d32c",
      "audio": "seg49.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946175884_13-spatial-db-seg49.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "GiST 索引靠外接矩形（ && ）先粗筛。 STDWithin 内部会先做 bbox 判断，所以比 STDistance < x 快得多。",
      "hash": "64b65338274e84dd",
      "audio": "seg50.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946180566_13-spatial-db-seg50.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "最近邻：",
      "hash": "20521c8a6229da7b",
      "audio": "seg51.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946175300_13-spatial-db-seg51.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "GiST 靠外接矩形（ && ）先粗筛，再做精确判断",
      "hash": "718e0358beb8c528",
      "audio": "seg52.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946196947_13-spatial-db-seg52.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "能走索引： && + STIntersects 、 STDWithin 、 ORDER BY geom <-> 点",
      "hash": "9c55ac6813e179e5",
      "audio": "seg53.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946199686_13-spatial-db-seg53.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "走不了索引： STDistance(geom, p) < r ，全表逐行算距离",
      "hash": "c10ccb59c1c7763f",
      "audio": "seg54.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946201338_13-spatial-db-seg54.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "最近邻固定写法： ORDER BY geom <-> 点 LIMIT n",
      "hash": "47f22bf2cda08975",
      "audio": "seg55.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946204949_13-spatial-db-seg55.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "乘客在 (116.4, 39.9)，要找最近的 5 辆车，表里有 500 万条车辆位置：",
      "hash": "2c2421abc952f59d",
      "audio": "seg56.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946206243_13-spatial-db-seg56.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "<-> 是 KNN运算符，直接在 GiST 索引上按距离排序，毫秒级出结果。等价的「笨写法」是先给 500 万行每行算一遍 STDistance ，再排序取前 5 条，结果一样，慢几百倍。",
      "hash": "728336cf3077397f",
      "audio": "seg57.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946202347_13-spatial-db-seg57.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "6. 三个静默错误",
      "hash": "e0fe49109d26ab6a",
      "audio": "seg58.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946204177_13-spatial-db-seg58.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "在 4326 上做 buffer ： STBuffer(geom, 1000) 得到的是「1000 度」的怪物。先 STTransform 到米制 CRS，或用 geography 。",
      "hash": "82c22d8c1b850c54",
      "audio": "seg59.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946208427_13-spatial-db-seg59.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "只改 SRID 不转换 ： STSetSRID 只是换标签，位置不变。",
      "hash": "30b1eca2f5965903",
      "audio": "seg60.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946207456_13-spatial-db-seg60.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "在 3857 上量面积 ：高纬度面积被严重高估；用等积投影或 geography 。",
      "hash": "292f4dcea6cdbc2c",
      "audio": "seg61.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946216281_13-spatial-db-seg61.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "4326 上 STBuffer(geom, 1000) 得到的是「 1000 度 」的怪物，先 STTransform 到米制 CRS，或用 geography",
      "hash": "1e8c760e1f81c8e4",
      "audio": "seg62.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946212360_13-spatial-db-seg62.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "STSetSRID 不换算坐标 ，只改 SRID 标签",
      "hash": "ec6c4134c8a16352",
      "audio": "seg63.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946207034_13-spatial-db-seg63.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "3857 不能量面积 ，高纬度严重高估，用等积投影或 geography",
      "hash": "efc1888d3484f7ea",
      "audio": "seg64.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946207936_13-spatial-db-seg64.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "这三类错都 不报错 ，只返回错误结果，必须形成肌肉记忆",
      "hash": "47e4fa5e732d0e68",
      "audio": "seg65.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946213476_13-spatial-db-seg65.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "在北京（约 40°N）量一块真实面积 100 平方公里的地块：",
      "hash": "ee9c41a5b64568db",
      "audio": "seg66.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946213457_13-spatial-db-seg66.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Web Mercator的线性放大倍数 = 1 / cos(40°) 约等于 1.31",
      "hash": "7c6c6bfd9240cfe1",
      "audio": "seg67.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946219368_13-spatial-db-seg67.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "面积放大倍数 = 线性倍数的平方 约等于 1.31 × 1.31 约等于 1.70",
      "hash": "00deb48c230737a9",
      "audio": "seg68.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946212667_13-spatial-db-seg68.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "STArea 在 3857 上返回约 170 平方公里 ，凭空多出 70%，且不报错。",
      "hash": "3698669f08f1fd74",
      "audio": "seg69.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946218423_13-spatial-db-seg69.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "换成等积投影，或用 geography 类型的 STArea ，才会得到接近 100 平方公里的正确值。",
      "hash": "f003a26cf07c1339",
      "audio": "seg70.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946218658_13-spatial-db-seg70.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "7. 组合建议",
      "hash": "f2563214c971f955",
      "audio": "seg71.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946227510_13-spatial-db-seg71.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "展示/交互：Turf 在前端，数据量小、延迟低。",
      "hash": "4946e8bec91114a8",
      "audio": "seg72.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946223562_13-spatial-db-seg72.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "需要索引、事务、大数据、精确统计：PostGIS。",
      "hash": "4869acc61cd6d31d",
      "audio": "seg73.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946226817_13-spatial-db-seg73.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "前端只传参数，后端返回 GeoJSON： STAsGeoJSON(STTransform(...)) 。",
      "hash": "e71ca981ab8f862e",
      "audio": "seg74.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946221064_13-spatial-db-seg74.mp3"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "延伸阅读",
      "hash": "e558bd3b8ec12c95",
      "audio": "seg75.mp3",
      "publicUrl": "https://cloudflare-imgbed-91r.pages.dev/file/gis/1793946223381_13-spatial-db-seg75.mp3"
    },
    {
